   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Basic information",
     "texto": [
      "A rental advert shows the **leiebolig** (rental property), the **husleie** (monthly rent) and the **depositum** (deposit). **Utleier** is the person who rents out the property; **leietaker**, the person who lives there and pays."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing the flat",
     "texto": [
      "**Romslig** means spacious and **sentral**, central. **Inkludert** indicates that a cost is included. In Norwegian, **strøm** can refer to electricity, which is paid separately."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
